<span style=3D"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;">PART I</span></h2>
<h2 style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-=
left: 40px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; color: r=
gb(0, 0, 0);">
<span style=3D"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;">Preliminary Matter =A1=AA W=
orking Language vs. Official Language</span></h2>
<div style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin: 16px 0px 16px 40p=
x; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
To ensure legal certainty in our exchanges, we propose that <b>English</b>&=
nbsp;be the official language of the framework agreement and its appendices=
. French and Chinese, assisted by machine translation, will remain working =
tools intended to facilitate mutual understanding.</div>
<div style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin: 16px 0px 16px 40p=
x; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
For the Articles of Association (Statuts), however, the language is mandate=
d by Belgian law: they must be drafted and filed with the notary in
<b>French</b>. In this case, English and Chinese will only serve as working=
 translations with no official legal standing.</div>
<h2 style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-=
left: 40px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; color: r=
gb(0, 0, 0);">
<span style=3D"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;">Document 1 =A1=AA Articles =
of Association (Statuts)</span></h2>
<div style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin: 16px 0px 16px 40p=
x; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
We note with satisfaction that the provided text raised few comments. Your =
requested amendment regarding
<b>expense authorization</b>&nbsp;appears well-founded, and we accept it.</=
div>
<h2 style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-=
left: 40px; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; color: r=
gb(0, 0, 0);">
<span style=3D"font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;">Document 2 =A1=AA Commercia=
l Framework Agreement</span></h2>
<div style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin: 16px 0px 16px 40p=
x; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<b>1. Governing Language (Article 40)</b><br>
The language clause will be adapted in accordance with the preliminary matt=
er stated above:
<b>English</b>&nbsp;will become the official language of the contract, whil=
e French and Chinese will serve as working versions. This proposal is inten=
ded to prevent any potential misunderstandings.</div>
<div style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin: 16px 0px 16px 40p=
x; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<b>2. Governing Law and Dispute Resolution (Article 38)</b><br>
Since the company is incorporated in Belgium, <b>Belgian law</b>&nbsp;is ap=
plicable in the first instance. Applying Singaporean or Hong Kong law in co=
njunction with a Brussels jurisdiction would be unmanageable for our operat=
ions and is not acceptable to us. However,
 for disputes requiring mediation or arbitration, we gladly accept a seat i=
n <b>Switzerland</b>(Geneva, for example).</div>
<div style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin: 16px 0px 16px 40p=
x; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<b>3. Supply Terms =A1=AA Price Stability (Article 14)</b><br>
We wish to guarantee the long-term price stability of our partnership. We p=
ropose to jointly define a mechanism to regulate the evolution of transfer =
prices (review period, indexation, arm's length principle). Could you pleas=
e indicate how you plan to avoid
 price fluctuations without prior discussion, so that we can identify a com=
mon approach?</div>
<div style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin: 16px 0px 16px 40p=
x; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<b>4. Definition of Related Companies (Articles 24 and 26, Appendix 10)</b>=
<br>
The links between Zheda Dixun and Diaho, which are clearly required and set=
 out in the contract, appear appropriate to us. However, we wish to jointly=
 clarify the definition of related companies and their reciprocal guarantee=
s, particularly with regard to Appendix
 10 (enhanced confidentiality and non-circumvention).</div>
<div style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin: 16px 0px 16px 40p=
x; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<b>5. Authority of Vetalyx (in connection with Articles 24 and 26)</b><br>
Furthermore, we want to ensure that Vetalyx retains full authority to enter=
 into strategic commercial partnerships with non-Chinese companies, as this=
 decision falls=A1=AAas a reminder=A1=AAunder the purview of the Board of D=
irectors.</div>
<div style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin: 16px 0px 16px 40p=
x; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<b>6. Signature of Zheda Dixun</b><br>
Since Zheda Dixun is explicitly named in the contract and is a shareholder =
of Diaho, would it not be wise for Dixun to also sign the agreement? This a=
djustment would clarify to third parties the respective roles of Diaho and =
Dixun, as well as their reciprocal
 guarantees.</div>
<div style=3D"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin: 16px 0px 16px 40p=
x; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
Aside from these points, the other comments and amendments received do not =
raise any issues and are not deal-breakers; we propose to refine them durin=
g the next phase of discussions.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin: 1=
6px 0px 16px 40px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: =
rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<b>PART II</b></div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin: 1=
2px 0px 12px 40px; font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-s=
ize: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
Here is the adaptations related to your and our remarks. we send you 3 file=
